.tmp-package/
node_modules/
.vercel
.env*
backups/

# Audit corpora are RE-EXPORTED before every run, never read from disk as current.
# A committed corpus is the exact trap scripts/hero-fold-audit/README.md warns about:
# it looks authoritative and is stale. Committed by accident (git add -A) on
# 2026-09-02 and untracked the same day — it had already gone stale by 22 pages.
scripts/*/corpus.json
scripts/*/audit_input.json
scripts/*/squeeze_results.json
